flowchart TB
    Providers[Flight provider APIs / email parsing] --> Adapters[Adapters: normalize events]
    Adapters --> Queue[Durable queue + retry / backoff]
    Queue --> Dedup[Validate event_id / source timestamp]
    Dedup --> Engine[Trip orchestration + impact rules]
    Engine --> Rules[Alternatives: visa / baggage / timezones / group]
    Rules --> Approve[Approval by traveller]
    Approve --> Booking[Booking supplier APIs - production only]
    Engine --> State[Travel plan database / versioned revisions]
    Engine --> Notice[Notification queue: push / email / in-app]
    Notice --> Offline[Offline sync when connection returns]
    State --> UI[Traveller / group interface]
    Offline --> UI
